{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>人稱「King Sir」的戲劇大師鍾景輝，今日（3日）驚傳離世，其姪兒向大眾宣布伯父已於今早在家中睡夢中安詳離世，享年89歲。鍾景輝在2016年證實患上大腸癌並接受手術後，仍繼續敬業樂業，2018年參與劇集《牛下女高音》演出，隨後淡出幕前專心休養。</p><figure><img alt=\"鍾景輝（左）及袁國強（右）獲樹仁大學頒授榮譽博士學位。（張浩維攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2152166/org/d7b7865b0301e8570f91d05771c0e9d1.jpg/b7Fc7kqd0NM6MZcNbe-uBDN6UiA2bHXBMPX9fSX1_X0\"/><figcaption>鍾景輝（左）及袁國強（右）獲樹仁大學頒授榮譽博士學位。（張浩維攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾景輝拍完《牛下女高音》後便淡出幕前。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/3561904/org/802b61940d15330d54c44635dcf58842.jpg/pfCbjcLYH6Fx4g0VTAhQm-KoP2uMaJBPnqFRBp6hUQY\"/><figcaption>鍾景輝拍完《牛下女高音》後便淡出幕前。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾景輝後生好有型呀。（Facebook圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240325/848974629363126272934610.jpeg/rl_0iquaF2aInzPvkTqqf68RyXzGo02vE1Ss3RNUrN0\"/><figcaption>鍾景輝後生好有型呀。（Facebook圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾景輝後生好有型呀。（Facebook圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240325/848974627114848256024631.jpeg/xP1q-G4sYGpmAKF81RpZApfCWzE0r85k6x6khusepIY\"/><figcaption>鍾景輝後生好有型呀。（Facebook圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁祖堯與湯駿業、劉錫賢及邵美君到King sir鍾景輝家中拜年。 （IG@pumpkinjojoinstagram）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240212/833774784671125504897103.jpeg/RE4AuzNKTmXr3Ir-Bp1wTiiImd7ToUECMJjzNjCY8zY\"/><figcaption>梁祖堯與湯駿業、劉錫賢及邵美君到King sir鍾景輝家中拜年。 （IG@pumpkinjojoinstagram）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁祖堯分享與King sir鍾景輝的合照。 （IG@pumpkinjojoinstagram）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240212/833774787418525696358271.jpeg/RUlTMa837XVhaqMjWkbq3Xrhl5kjISmzoNlQ-KDZUPg\"/><figcaption>梁祖堯分享與King sir鍾景輝的合照。 （IG@pumpkinjojoinstagram）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"King sir鍾景輝笑住派利是俾梁祖堯。 （IG@pumpkinjojoinstagram）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240212/833774792208683008804132.jpeg/mXDJYp1wR3w9UGvFdTe6SVvpUKbW7W6JxSOGWMUjhlg\"/><figcaption>King sir鍾景輝笑住派利是俾梁祖堯。 （IG@pumpkinjojoinstagram）</figcaption></figure><p>身為戲劇界殿堂級大師的鍾景輝，除了曾任香港演藝學院院長，更是TVB藝訓班的開山祖師，當年周潤發一開始未有取錄入藝訓班，亦是鍾景輝獨具慧眼，讓發哥入學，成就了一代影壇王者。桃李滿門鍾景輝的為演藝界培育不少人才，亦廣受圈中人敬重，去年3月88歲生日時，前港台DJ夏妙然就與倪秉郎帶着蛋糕到疑似護老院探望鍾景輝，片中所見，戴着帽的鍾景輝坐在床上，胸前有一塊護理布，背景疑在護老院院舍內，雖然有emoji為鍾景輝遮樣，但當大家為他唱生日歌時，亦可以聽見鍾景輝有跟唱幾句，並發出招牌笑聲。</p><figure><img alt=\"鍾景輝疑入住護老院舍內，裏面有衣櫃。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852398362726400254916.jpeg/GF4KL_CHAER2QMZHA7Py6kFNo437WyZzo1N4l6NTeJc\"/><figcaption>鍾景輝疑入住護老院舍內，裏面有衣櫃。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"King Sir都好開心。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852578705477632954832.jpeg/VCENb_PRsB_xsFW8Rrj-GfDypvHGDGVfSMUhCUjFIQk\"/><figcaption>King Sir都好開心。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"全程係床上。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852578701414400064371.jpeg/w25BxAxmwiGj9DbLNuyoAAX1hb0a3tdEfoYIa36GCGs\"/><figcaption>全程係床上。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"聽大家唱生日歌。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852577006784512378426.jpeg/wwR70urqiAjL6gGs8vyY66BKnCJHYCREDdyrew3cq3s\"/><figcaption>聽大家唱生日歌。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852575245045760791280.jpeg/IgOUDPbHKNcXKJ7B-pUIjwpuf_ck6joh1g3UX9YN1F8\"/><figcaption>鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852573235843072093518.jpeg/cvOdIWVHAIGsHibG3IRN6GuqQtnwzKqpnn0wE559MBM\"/><figcaption>鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852582526750720627059.jpeg/4gryTmQRjuNS9vEz0j7AaIi6Hqus3J5iNYfz0jWH89I\"/><figcaption>鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852576381702144968475.jpeg/8m5uGqDqd2HhspF7zbRpWsUTOGVky0Z1qlPmBapT5gU\"/><figcaption>鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852580744040448528901.jpeg/o0l0GixgBk_hMNAOJpCNWuQqV9MxfHNMepsyNnqbMjY\"/><figcaption>鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852573386838016380419.jpeg/8RRRY5BD2fWf1MpbV55F62eTewI8-8jqerd4XXq3eF0\"/><figcaption>鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏妙然多年來都有相約鍾景輝見敍舊。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852782816956416278356.jpeg/TLW1T1gO8IhAiZMZ7Nsnik96_42t1ZyEBUnFlAVJxZQ\"/><figcaption>夏妙然多年來都有相約鍾景輝見敍舊。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏妙然多年來都有相約鍾景輝見敍舊。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852780732256256296047.jpeg/9wpcHRdfBbfEdCYQeTNl3RR3InMA_XHTJ2wxjCdsMYw\"/><figcaption>夏妙然多年來都有相約鍾景輝見敍舊。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏妙然多年來都有相約鍾景輝見敍舊。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980853091442102272759381.jpeg/IIugdSupR1gMHbyQOQTPktl_rEQP4I4g0Okbd9DpG3c\"/><figcaption>夏妙然多年來都有相約鍾景輝見敍舊。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏妙然多年來都有相約鍾景輝見敍舊。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980853093702963200374261.jpeg/Dga4b0A0OH7TRHT_czSg03kM1Psr7pdzJYr84SWK_OE\"/><figcaption>夏妙然多年來都有相約鍾景輝見敍舊。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏妙然多年來都有相約鍾景輝見敍舊。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980853095817023488473280.jpeg/D4gHB9AcDT8HQcTpYQiMg47F1N0ERQdJwcrLZsHKy2Y\"/><figcaption>夏妙然多年來都有相約鍾景輝見敍舊。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏妙然多年來都有相約鍾景輝見敍舊。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980853097771700224630428.jpeg/mo-FCJpKF0DEKeY9bp1WprPnOBFRvSNaNfyybTX8sm0\"/><figcaption>夏妙然多年來都有相約鍾景輝見敍舊。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><p>而戲劇導師余俊峰亦前往探望鍾景輝，更帶對方到西貢海邊睇海景，見鍾景輝坐在輪椅上，精神尚可，但明顯比之前消瘦不少。</p><figure><img alt=\"鍾景輝明顯瘦咗。（IG@johnsonjunyu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852916543819776572346.jpeg/45ZTQXsF2QElQzRoaBHJsVEDYevuFtt0p7aurae2rq0\"/><figcaption>鍾景輝明顯瘦咗。（IG@johnsonjunyu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"余俊峰推住King Sir。（IG@johnsonjunyu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980853225160970240345607.jpeg/q_6W40GCY79C8qTzbHHzdSkx7ZqmbOFsu89vhbvPb4U\"/><figcaption>余俊峰推住King Sir。（IG@johnsonjunyu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"看海。（IG@johnsonjunyu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980853223009161216048159.jpeg/I8yCOSoR5u-pENwwpyuaIwU7U7nxW5XKSAgZfEgIGXw\"/><figcaption>看海。（IG@johnsonjunyu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"遊西貢。（IG@johnsonjunyu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980853220790243328546289.jpeg/Xq1voQ5HyEzZHBNDa_vI08FLwldNlb93flTgvH5U4Lw\"/><figcaption>遊西貢。（IG@johnsonjunyu）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-03T05:24:44.974508+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1368,"images":27,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}